lingmo-debinstaller (1.0.2+lingmo5u1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * fix: make listInstalledPackages and getPackageDetail async so the UI
    thread never blocks while dpkg-query runs.  Adds ListOperation and
    DetailOperation classes to debbackend.
  * fix: removePackage callback now calls setRunning(false) so the
    Remove/Update buttons re-enable after a removal.

